From 478216ff317ad19a4eafc25351622547976bc197 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stefan <46031448+StefanPetersTM@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:57:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] du: add isolated phone downlink compatibility controls

Carry the standards-valid SIB1 cadence/n0, SI power-sign, fallback aggregation and bounded-MCS controls used by the CP3114 phone proof. All overrides remain environment-gated and default to upstream behavior. Trace helpers are metadata-only and disabled by default. Refs CP2038, CP2722, CP3112, CP3114.
